  "title": "Kissed Gooey Chinese Pea Eggplant Stew",
  "description": "A traditional Cantonese dish featuring fermented pea eggplant in a savory stew, perfect for a weeknight dinner. This diabetic-friendly recipe is cooked to perfection in a kazan cauldron.",
