  "instructions": [
    "Heat the sesame oil in the kazan cauldron over medium heat.",
    "Add the diced pork belly and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and sliced ginger and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Add the fermented pea eggplant, soy sauce, oyster sauce, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Pour in 2 cups of water and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir in the chopped scallions and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with additional scallions if desired."
